{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":95,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"3b0846a2-7f62-422b-af62-f8d9851b2520","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351597643,"PostDateInt":1786517243000,"PostDate":"2026-08-12T14:47:23","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"封装工程师(J11588)","OrgId":811633,"Org":"封装","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"岗位职责:\n1.主导模拟类/功率类芯片(如PMIC、DCDC、功率驱动、MOS/GaN配套IC等)的封装方案开发，负责从Design-in、打样验证到量产爬坡的全流程导入(NPI)。\n2.独立完成封装基板(Substrate2L/4L)的电与结构设计，包括层叠架构(Stack-up)、线宽线距规则、阻抗控制、热过孔(Thermal Via)布局及铜厚优化；输出Gerber文件并跟进基板厂DFM评审。\n3.针对功率器件的高功耗特性，制定散热方案，结合热/应力仿真结果优化封装结构，确保产品结温、热阻及可靠性满足SPEC要求。\n4.对接OSAT，完成NPI的全流程导入，主导DOE验证、Qual认证、Safe Launch执行及Yield CIP(良率持续改善)，解决产线制程异常。\n5.完善基板类封装设计规范、BOM选型库，推动封装技术标准化，并主导关键材料的国产化替代与SecondSource导入.","Require":"任职要求:\n1.本科及以上学历，微电子、电子工程、材料科学或相关专业;具备3年以上半导体封装设计/工程经验，有DrMOS、GAN等功率类产品导入经验者优先。\n2.熟练使用基板设计工具(如Cadence APD)精通2L/4L基板设计规则，理解阻抗控制与过流设计原理。\n3.熟悉NPI项目管理流程，具备DOE设计、Qual验证及YieldCIP实战经验;有OSAT协同管理经验，能与工厂协同解决封装制程异常。\n4.具备良好的跨部门沟通协调能力及英语技术文档阅读能力；熟悉封装材料(塑封料、DieAttach等)特性，有国产化材料导入或车规级(AEC-Q100)项目经验者佳。","ClassificationOne":"生产运营类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription